Ink. Say it with me. Ink!

9
00:00:48.325 --> 00:00:51.725
Button. Say it with me. Button!

10
00:00:55.201 --> 00:00:59.001
Page. Say it with me. Page!

11
00:01:02.536 --> 00:01:06.285
Copy. Say it with me. Copy!

12
