13
00:01:17.003 --> 00:01:25.037
A printer turns my digital document into a paper copy. I press print, and the printer uses ink to make a page.

14
00:01:25.087 --> 00:01:28.266
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:29.001 --> 00:01:34.321
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.371 --> 00:01:35.521
Print!

17
00:01:36.406 --> 00:01:41.767
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:41.817 --> 00:01:42.967
Copy!

19
00:01:43.854 --> 00:01:52.134
Did you know? The very first printer was invented a very long time before computers even existed!

20
00:01:52.184 --> 00:01:54.867
